    NIFRID:abbrev "Mouse SNP" ;
    definition: "THIS RESOURCE IS NO LONGER IN SERVICE, documented on July 17, 2013. This website contains a database of the mouse SNP. DNA sequencing was performed along with genotyping. There is information on genotyping, mouse strain, and haplotype map." .

SCR:000034 a NLX:63400,
