    definition: "Multi-channel data acquisition software. Multi-channel stimulation/acquisition software with programmable experiment control and automation, software Lock-in amplifier and Photometry/Imaging extension. PATCHMASTER supports all HEKA amplifiers and data acquisition hardware." .

SCR:000035 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
