    definition: "Software that identifies and classifies protein kinases in a user-provided fasta file using an HMM derived from serine / threonine protein kinases, a position specific scoring matrix derived from the HMM, and comparison with a local version of the curated kinase database from kinase.com." .

SCR:000353 a NLX:63400,
