    rdfs:label "Creative Diagnostics" ;
    definition: "An antibody supplier that also provides diagnostic components, assay reagents and contract biologic RandD and manufacturing services. The company focuses on providing services to help clients develop, manufacture and commercialize their products." .

SCR:000368 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "biotools:nucleofinder",
        "OMICS_00510" ;
    rdfs:label "NucleoFinder" ;
    definition: "A software for a statistical approach for the detection of nucleosome positions in a cell population. The software identifies important features of nucleosome organization such as the spacing downstream of active promoters and the enrichment and depletion of GC/AT dinucleotides of in vitro nucleosomes." .

SCR:000369 a NLX:152328,
