    rdfs:label "SciRoKo" ;
    definition: "Comparative genomics software that assists in whole genome microsatellite search and investigation. The command line version is called SciRoKoCo. The perl script DesignPrimer can be used to design PCR primer pairs for the SciRoKo output." .

SCR:000942 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
