    rdfs:label "Indian Council of Medical Research; New Delhi; India" ;
    NIFRID:abbrev "ICMR" ;
    definition: "A government-funded council for the promotion and coordination of biomedical research in India. The council focuses on specific diseases such as HIV/AIDS, tuberculosis, and leprosy in addition to national health priorities including the management of communicable diseases, fertility control, and mental health research." .

SCR:000969 a NLX:152328,
