    NIFRID:synonym "Indian Institute of Science" ;
    NIFRID:abbrev "IISc" ;
    definition: "A public research university for science and higher education in India. The university has six main divisions, including the biological sciences, chemical sciences, electrical sciences, mechanical sciences, physical and mathematical sciences, and interdisciplinary research." .

SCR:000970 a NLX:63400,
