    definition: "A high-performance visualization tool for interactive exploration of large, integrated genomic datasets written primarily in JavaScript. It supports a wide variety of data types, including array-based and next-generation sequence data, and genomic annotations." .

SCR:001005 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
