        "OMICS_02165" ;
    rdfs:label "Illuminator" ;
    definition: "A sequence alignment program for the output from Illumina GA-II clonal sequencers. It uses an algorithm that indexes the reference sequence as a series of 8-mers and then matches the genomic reads to the 8-mer index, in a mutation-tolerant way permitting identification of single-nucleotide substitutions and indels." .

