    definition: "A portal listing Miami University's labs and facilities which include the Center for Bioinformatics and Functional Genomics. The CBFG is the onsite core molecular biology and bioinformatics resource at Miami University that focuess mainly on DNA and protein analysis as well as expertise in robotics liquid handling." .

SCR:001041 a NLX:63400,
