SCR:001043 a NLX:152342,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "SciEx_4856" ;
    rdfs:label "MS Bioworks" ;
    NIFRID:synonym "MS Bioworks - Protein Mass Spectrometry Services" ;
    definition: "A protein mass spectrometry service provider that delivers data to industrial and government organizations as well as academic institutions. Protein services include protein identification, mapping, profiling, and mass measurement. Post-translational modification services include PTM profiling, phospho-screening, and glyco-screening. Quantitative proteomics services include workflows for label free, TMT, SILAC, and PRM. MS Bioworks also provides immunoprecipitated protein analysis and custom analysis." .

SCR:001044 a NLX:63400,
