    definition: "Portal for Louisiana State University labs and facilities which include the AgCenter Biotechnology Laboratory, a core facility that provides basic and applied research expertise to support researchers in the LSU system as well as those in other academic institutions and industry. The ABL consists of three units: the Protein Facility, the Plant Transformation Facility and the Animal Cell Culture Facility." .

