        "University at Albany CFG Proteomics Core Facility" ;
    definition: "A core facility that provides services in the identification of individual proteins, characterization of entire protein complexes or biosimilars, and global analysis to discover changes in the proteomes of different samples. The core also specializes in the development of custom assays for quantitation of specific molecules in complex clinical samples." .

SCR:001049 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "SciEx_565" ;
    rdfs:label "Show of Hands" ;
    NIFRID:synonym "Show of Hands Mobile Polling" ;
    definition: "A mobile application for real-time mobile polling on topics that include politics, ethics, pop culture, sports, health, and humor. Poll results can be filtered by gender, political party, age, or income range. The app is available for iPhone, iPad, Android devices, and Kindle Fire." .

SCR:001050 a NLX:152342,
