    NIFRID:synonym "RettBase" ;
    definition: "Database constructed by merging mutation and polymorphism data from the published literature pertaining to Rett syndrome and related clinical disorders, and by incorporating unpublished mutation and polymorphism data that have been submitted directly. RettBase is updated on a very frequent basis manually by curators to ensure the validity of the data submitted., THIS RESOURCE IS NO LONGER IN SERVICE. Documented on September 16,2025." .

