    definition: "THIS RESOURCE IS NO LONGER IN SERVICE. Documented on September 23,2022. DOCUMENTED NOVEMBER 17, 2016: This program was removed on 03/18/15 and is not being monitored.A software visualization package for the symbolic display of functional neuroimaging datasets in an anatomical context. Written in IDL." .

SCR:001081 a NLX:152328,
