        "nlx_11001",
        "Wikidata:Q1375146" ;
    rdfs:label "Murdoch University; Perth; Australia" ;
    definition: "Public university in Perth, Western Australia, with campuses also in Singapore and Dubai. It began operations as the state's second university on 25 July 1973, and accepted its first undergraduate students in 1975." .

