    rdfs:label "Dartmouth College; New Hampshire; USA" ;
    definition: "Private Ivy League research university in Hanover, New Hampshire, United States. Established in 1769 by Eleazar Wheelock, Dartmouth is one of the nine colonial colleges chartered before the American Revolution." .

