    NIFRID:synonym "Duke University" ;
    NIFRID:abbrev "Duke" ;
    definition: "Private research university in Durham, North Carolina. Founded by Methodists and Quakers in 1838. Home of Blue Devils, Duke University has undergraduate and graduate students and world class faculty." .

