    NIFRID:abbrev "FSU" ;
    definition: "Florida State University is a public research university in Tallahassee, Florida, United States. It is a senior member of the State University System of Florida and a preeminent university in the state. Chartered in 1851, it is located on Florida's oldest continuous site of higher education." .

SCR:011229 a NLX:152328,
