    definition: "Hospital known officially as the Sir Mortimer B. Davis Jewish General Hospital since 1978, is an acute-care teaching hospital in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. The hospital is affiliated with McGill University" .

SCR:011330 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "grid.14830.3e",
