        "ISNI:0000 0004 1936 8649",
        "nlx_60719",
        "Wikidata:Q201492" ;
    rdfs:label "McGill University; Montreal; Canada" ;
    NIFRID:synonym "McGill",
        "McGill University" ;
    definition: "Public research university in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. Founded in 1821 by royal charter granted by King George IV, the university bears the name of James McGill, a Scottish merchant whose bequest in 1813 formed the university's precursor, University of McGill College. Name was officially changed to McGill University in 1885." .

