    NIFRID:abbrev "VUSM" ;
    definition: "Vanderbilt University School of Medicine trains leaders in medicine by providing the best faculty and physicians in the best learning environment for the best students in the world. We are known for our personal attention and our customized medical education. Our research program is the fastest growing in the U.S. But our ranking among the top medical schools comes not just from an innovative curriculum and state-of-the-art facilities. It comes from our commitment to people." .

