    NIFRID:synonym "Circular Genome Viewer" ;
    definition: "A Java package for generating high quality, zoomable maps of circular genomes. Its primary purpose is to serve as a component of sequence annotation pipelines, as a means of generating visual output suitable for the web., THIS RESOURCE IS NO LONGER IN SERVICE. Documented on September 16,2025." .

SCR:011780 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
