    NIFRID:synonym "MetaVelvet: a short read assember for metagenomics" ;
    definition: "Software for a short read de novo metagenome assembly created by modifying and extending a single-genome and de Bruijn-graph based assembler, Velvet." .

SCR:011916 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
