    NIFRID:synonym "PROkaryotic DYnamic programming Gene-finding ALgorithm",
        "Prokaryotic Dynamic Programming Genefinding Algorithm" ;
    definition: "Software tool for protein coding gene prediction for prokaryotic genomes." .

SCR:011937 a NLX:63400,
