    NIFRID:synonym "Real Time Genomics (RTG Metagenomics)" ;
    NIFRID:abbrev "rtgMetagenomics" ;
    definition: "Delivers comprehensive shotgun metagenomics sequence analysis for accurate species frequency composition and protein searching." .

SCR:011950 a NLX:63400,
