    definition: "THIS RESOURCE IS NO LONGER IN SERVICE. Documented on May 5,2024. Provides range of high-quality genomics services, including next generation sequencing (whole exome, pre-designed panels, custom panels, RNA-Seq) and microarray processing (aCGH-CNV, miRNA, gene expression)." .

