    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "nlx_152357" ;
    rdfs:label "Epitomics" ;
    definition: "Original provider of rabbit monoclonal antibodies. Important Note for Epitomics Customers in the U.S.: As of Jan. 28, 2013, orders for Epitomics products will now be handled directly by Abcam." .

