    definition: "Software assembler and analysis tool for whole-genome short-gun sequencing for Illumina reads. Provides tools for error correction, sequence-to-read alignment and comparison between read sets. Used for large genomes." .

SCR:016653 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
