    definition: "Software for rapid and sensitive classification of metagenomic sequences. Used for the classification of DNA sequences from microbial samples and analysis of large metagenomics data sets on conventional desktop computers." .

SCR:016666 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
