    NIFRID:synonym "Janelia MouseLight project",
        "Mouse Light",
        "Mouse Light Project",
        "MouseLight",
        "The Mouse Light Project" ;
    definition: "Software imaging platform to generate datasets of whole mouse brains imaged at submicron resolution that allow reconstructions of complete axonal arbors of individual neurons across the entire mouse brain." .

SCR:016669 a NLX:63400,
