    rdfs:label "Beckman Coulter | DiaSorin LIAISON XL Chemiluminescence Immunoassay Analyzer" ;
    definition: "Chemiluminescence Immunoassay Analyzer closes care gap and addresses challenges with blood viruses and infectious diseases." .

