    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Model_Number_BiOS",
        "SCR_019974" ;
    rdfs:label "Hamilton | BiOS Automated Ultra Low Temperature Freezer system" ;
    definition: "BiOS is automated bio freezer storage system specifically designed to store sensitive biological samples. This ultra low temperature freezer is capable of reaching temperatures as low as minus 80°C, ensuring biological specimen integrity. BiOS can be scaled to fit your laboratory needs as a premier option for storing biological samples.Automated sample storage platforms run on INSTINCT S software." .

