    definition: "Assay ready workstation used for magnetic bead based nucleic acid extraction and isolation of pathogen RNA from SARS CoV 2, which causes Coronavirus Disease 2019. It is designed to be used with variety of kit chemistries from leading partners, including those that are FDA approved, and can process up to 96 samples at time." .

