SCR:020061 a NLX:63400,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Model_Number_Fluorolog-3" ;
    rdfs:label "Horiba | Fluorolog-3 Spectrofluorometer" ;
    definition: "Fluorolog-3 is a , modular system which allows the researcher to interchange a wide range of accessories to correspond precisely with the characteristics of a given sample. From analysis of steady-state or molecular dynamics to IR probes, the Fluorolog-3 comes equipped with a wide range and limitless configuration of accessories to enhance the accuracy and speed of it's performance. The Fluorolog-3 series enables you to customize your spectrofluorometer's performance to meet your research needs. It can also perform (TCSPC) Time Correlated Single Photon Counting lifetime measurements like the FluoroMax-4 and QM800." .

