    definition: "Triple channel handheld water quality meter that has large colour graphic LCD screen, measuring 70 x 52 mm, with backlight and built in foldable meter stand. It is IP67 waterproof and dustproof, battery and USB powered, eco friendly, shock proof, scratch resistant, and non slip." .

